# The private build pipeline. These two scripts name the client, a named individual and
# the candidate pilot areas. They belong in the private repository that produces this
# one, never here: this repository is the PUBLIC output, hosted on GitHub Pages, and
# tools/build_public_demo.py is the sanitiser whose whole job is to keep those terms out
# of it. They are kept on disk for reference and are never to be committed.
tools/build_demo_data.py
tools/build_public_demo.py

# Merge leftovers. A committed .orig is 90 KB of dead weight with conflict markers
# still in it, and it will be served by Pages and found by every grep.
*.orig
*.rej
